          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most homes, the best stud finder setup costs well under $75: a Franklin multi-sensor array for drywall and a CH Hanson magnet for plaster, tile and second opinions. That pair finds framing faster and with fewer false readings than the single-sensor tools most people grew up with.
          </p>
