            Step up to a Zircon or Bosch scanner if wire and metal detection matter for your work, and to a Walabot only when you are planning a renovation. Whatever tool you use, scan at more than one height, confirm with a test hole, keep clear of the space above and below outlets, and put heavy loads into wood.
